title: Start
---
Hello traveler, find the shop keeper - he's a cool guy

<<declare $quest = "find shopkeeper">>

===

title: TalkToShopKeeper
---
<<if $quest == "find shopkeeper">>
  Buenos Dias Nacho Brochacho, I need money please gimmie a coin.
  <<set $quest to "find coin">>
<<elseif $quest == "find coin">>
  Ay im so poor     
  <<if has_item("Player", "shiny")>>
     Dios Mio you have a coin, thx gng.
  <<else>>
     need me some coin, some scrach, some cheddar
  <<endif>>  
<<endif>>
===

title: MissionStart
---
Alright, finally made it in here.
Can't beleive they assigned me to a station so far this close to the holidays. 
Heh, really squeezing the most labour they can possibly get outta me...
Oh well, Jobs a job, not like theres anyone else to work for in the star system. Gotta eat somehow.
But why here? This place is a Ghost town. I couldn't even find records on when it was abbandoned?
Whatever, I gotta find a terminal and establish a connection with homebase. 
===

title: LockedDoor
---
Huh, doors locked.
This doors too old to be acces from my neurochip
should be an overide button here.. or two
good thing I brought a flashlight -f-
<<set $quest to "meetScrubsQuest">>
===

title: meetScrubs
---
Huh? They sent another? About time!
You've got no idea how long I've just spent trying to repair this damn terminal. 
Man I'm so hungry, do they really expect us to survive through operations with such small rations? 
Anyways, I'm Scrubs, I assume you're here for the same reason I am
... which we dont know, YET.
With this terminal working now we should be able to get our instructions from homebase
Let's get this done quick, this place gives me the creeps. 
I mean seriously, why send an expedition this close to a black hole? I highly doubt an abandoned mining rigs gonna have anything THAT valuable.  
<<if $quest == "meetScrubsQuest">>
 <<set $quest to "contactHQQuest">>
<<endif>>
===

title: contactHQ
---
<<if $quest == "contactHQQuest">>
  INITIATING POST
  POST SUCESSFULL
  BOOTING STATION OS 
  ...
  ...
  WELCOME
  AQUILA CORP NEUROCHIP DETECTED - EXTRACTOR ID 7702eI
  REQUEST CURRENT DIRECTIVES?
  well, yeah
  PING SENT 
  ...
  ...
  DIRECTIVES RECEIVED
  GAIN ACCESS TO STATION CENTRAL HUB AND AWAIT FURTHER INSTRUCTIONS 
  END MESSAGE
  *Scrubs looks over to you*
  Huh, guess thats that
  why'd the corp wanna restore this place? it's a junkyard
  they can't possibly want to recomission it, especially with how close that black hole it is
  unless this is another way of laying off without having to send severance packages
  I get it, neurmail's expensive these days, heheh 
  Anyways, we'll need to activate the backup power if we wanna get to the main hub.
  could you take one for the team and re activate the station batteries? I'm like, really beat from this terminall
  this button behind me should unlock the baterry room down the hall
  according to the station doccumentation there are 3 ovveride buttons linked to the batteries
  no schematics though, so you'll have to find them yourself. Sorry bro.
  If you do get the doors to open then just head to the hub without me, i'll have to finnish up some wiring whilst i'm still down here
  <<set $quets to "ReactivatePower">>
<<endif>>

===

title: level1Note
---
you find an old paper note that reads: 
To whoever keeps downloading unauthorised homebrews to the projector for films PLEASE STOP
tamering with equipment without permission will garuantee a VERY DEEP pay cut
You know Aquilla doesn't stand for employees stepping out of line so from the bottmom of my heart
PLease stop, or else we'll all be eating the cheap and bland nutripaste for the next dozen cycles
Synth meats already enough of a delecacy...
===